  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><span aria-current=\"page\">Pricing</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Pricing</p>\n        <h1 class=\"display\">Published prices. No quote wall.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Every plan includes human editorial review, a permanent hosted release page and pickup reporting. Pay per release, or upgrade to Studio if you are publishing every week.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a release</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"compare.html\">Compare with other wires</a></div>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight pt-0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  PressCosmos costs $149 per release on the Launch plan, $349 on Amplify, $899 on Newsmaker, or $1,990 per month on Studio for up to twelve releases. There are no per-seat fees and no annual contract required for per-release plans. All plans include editorial review and permanent hosting.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"plan-grid\">\n<article class=\"card plan spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <h3>Launch</h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">For a single announcement that needs to land properly.</p>\n  <p class=\"plan-price\"><span class=\"amount gradient-text\">$149</span><span class=\"unit\">per release</span></p>\n  <ul><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Tier 2 regional + trade distribution</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>AI answer-engine formatting (AEO/GEO/LLMO)</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>1 image or video embed</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Basic pickup report</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Editorial review in 4 business hours</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Permanent hosted release page</span></li></ul>\n  <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-block\" href=\"submit.html?plan=launch\">Start with Launch</a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card plan spotlight is-popular\" data-reveal>\n  <span class=\"plan-badge\">Most popular</span>\n  <h3>Amplify</h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">The plan most teams run for a full announcement cycle.</p>\n  <p class=\"plan-price\"><span class=\"amount gradient-text\">$349</span><span class=\"unit\">per release</span></p>\n  <ul><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Tier 1 national