e</span></p>\n  <ul><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Everything in Amplify</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Terminal, analyst-desk and broadcast wire delivery</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Guaranteed top-tier placement lanes</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>10-language syndication bundle</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Journalist outreach and pitch drafting</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Real-time monitoring alerts and crisis lane access</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Same-day strategy session with a PR lead</span></li></ul>\n  <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-block\" href=\"submit.html?plan=newsmaker\">Start with Newsmaker</a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card plan spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <h3>Studio</h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Ongoing newsroom operations for teams shipping news weekly.</p>\n  <p class=\"plan-price\"><span class=\"amount gradient-text\">$1,990</span><span class=\"unit\">per month</span></p>\n  <ul><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Up to 12 releases per month</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Branded custom newsroom on your domain</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Dedicated editorial and SEO strategist</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Quarterly share-of-answer and AI citation audit</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Agency multi-client workspace</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>API access and Zapier automation</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Priority crisis lane, 24/7 standby</span></li></ul>\n  <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-block\" href=\"submit.html?plan=studio\">Start with Studio</a>\n</article></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Compare</p>\n      <h2>What is actually different between the plans</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"table-scroll\" data-reveal>\n    <table class=\"compare\">\n      <caption class=\"visually-hidden\">Feature comparison across PressCosmos plans</caption>\n      <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Feature</th><th scope=\"col\">Launch</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"col-highlight\">Amplify</th><th scope=\"col\">Newsmaker</th><th scope=\"col\">Studio</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Distribution tier</th><td class=\"col-highlight \">Tier 2–3</td><td class=\" \">Tier 1–3</td><td class=\" \">Tier 1–4 + terminals</td><td class=\" \">Tier 1–4 + terminals</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Editorial review</th><td class=\"col-highlight \">4 business hours</td><td class=\" \">60 minutes</td><td class=\" \">60 minutes</td><td class=\" \">Priority queue</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">AI answer-engine formatting</th><td class=\"col-highlight \">Included</td><td class=\" \">Included</td><td class=\" \">Included</td><td class=\" \">Included</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Share-of-answer tracking</th><td class=\"col-highlight no\">—</td><td class=\" \">9 engines</td><td class=\" \">9 engines</td><td class=\" \">9 engines + quarterly audit</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Languages</th><td class=\"col-highlight \">1</td><td class=\" \">3</td><td class=\" \">10</td><td class=\" \">Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Multimedia embeds</th><td class=\"col-highlight \">1 asset</td><td class=\" \">Unlimited</td><td class=\" \">Unlimited</td><td class=\" \">Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Pickup map & sentiment</th><td class=\"col-highlight \">Basic</td><td class=\" \">Full</td><td class=\" \">Full + alerts</td><td class=\" \">Full + alerts</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Backlink inventory</th><td class=\"col-highlight \">Summary</td><td class=\" \">Full</td><td class=\" \">Full</td><td class=\" \">Full</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Branded newsroom</th><td class=\"col-highlight no\">—</td><td class=\" no\">—</td><td class=\" \">Add-on</td><td class=\" \">Included</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Crisis lane</th><td class=\"col-highlight \">Add-on</td><td class=\" \">Add-on</td><td class=\" \">Included</td><td class=\" \">Included</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Journalist outreach</th><td class=\"col-highlight no\">—</td><td class=\" no\">—</td><td class=\" \">Included</td><td class=\" \">Included</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Account manager</th><td class=\"col-highlight no\">—</td><td class=\" \">Dedicated</td><td class=\" \">Dedicated</td><td class=\" \">Strategic + editorial</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:var(--step--1)\">API & automation</th><td class=\"col-highlight no\">—</td><td class=\" no\">—</td><td class=\" no\">—</td><td class=\" \">Included</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Add-ons</p>\n      <h2>Extras, priced individually</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-4\">\n    <article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-1);font-weight:700\">$89</p>\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step-0)\">Translation</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Per additional language, native-speaker reviewed.</p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-1);font-weight:700\">$199/mo</p>\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step-0)\">Branded newsroom</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Hosted newsroom on your domain, any plan.</p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-1);font-weight:700\">$249/mo</p>\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step-0)\">Crisis lane</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">24/7 standby editor and 60-minute publishing.</p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-1);font-weight:700\">$199</p>\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step-0)\">Journalist outreach</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Manual pitching to a targeted list of 25 writers.</p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-1);font-weight:700\">$29</p>\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step-0)\">Extra multimedia</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Per asset beyond your plan allowance.</p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-1);font-weight:700\">Free</p>\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step-0)\">Correction distribution</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">When the correction is for our error. $49 otherwise.</p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-1);font-weight:700\">$399</p>\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step-0)\">AI visibility audit</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Baseline across nine engines plus 90-day tracking.</p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-1);font-weight:700\">$99/mo</p>\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step-0)\">API access</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Programmatic submission and reporting endpoints.</p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Volume</p>\n      <h2>Agency and enterprise pricing</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"split\">\n    <div class=\"stack prose\" style=\"--flow:1rem\">\n      <p>If you distribute ten or more releases a month, list pricing stops being sensible. Volume pricing starts 22% below list and scales with commitment.</p>\n      <p>Agency workspaces add multi-client separation, white-label reporting and shared routing presets. Enterprise adds SAML SSO, approval chains, audit logging, custom retention and a signed data processing agreement.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:1.6rem\">\n      <ul class=\"list-check\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Volume discount from 10 releases per month</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>White-label dashboards for agency clients</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>SSO, SCIM and audit logging on enterprise</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>DPA, custom retention and regional data residency</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Invoice and PO billing on annual terms</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Named onboarding and quarterly business review</span></li></ul>\n      <p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-block\" href=\"contact.html\">Request a workspace quote</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"split\" style=\"align-items:start\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\" data-reveal>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Answers</p>\n        <h2>Pricing questions</h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"mt-3 muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Still stuck? <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Talk to a specialist <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-list\" data-accordion=\"single\">\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Do I need a subscription?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">No. Launch, Amplify and Newsmaker are pay-per-release with no recurring commitment. Studio is an optional monthly plan for teams publishing regularly.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">What happens if my release is rejected?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">You receive a credit for the full amount and a written explanation with suggestions for making the announcement publishable. Rejections are rare and almost always about missing disclosure or unverifiable claims.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Can I upgrade mid-campaign?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes. Upgrades apply instantly to any release not yet published, and the difference is prorated. Published releases cannot be retroactively upgraded because the syndication has already happened.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Do you offer agency or volume pricing?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes. Agencies distributing ten or more releases per month, and any organisation running a Studio plan, get volume pricing starting at 22% below list. Contact our sales team for a workspace quote.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">What is PressCosmos?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">PressCosmos is a press release distribution and AI visibility platform. You write or upload an announcement, our editors review it, and we syndicate it to newswire partners, trade media, regional press and AI answer engines while tracking every pickup, backlink and AI citation you earn.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">How is PressCosmos different from a traditional newswire?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Traditional wires optimise for a press release existing on the internet. PressCosmos optimises for your announcement being found, quoted and repeated — by journalists, by search engines and by AI assistants. Every release ships with answer-engine formatting, structured data and entity markup by default.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Try one release at list price.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">No onboarding fee, no minimum commitment, and the reporting is yours to keep.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a press release</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"pricing.html\">See pricing</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">No subscription required · Cancel anytime · Human editorial review on every release</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "priority": 0.95
}
